flowchart TD
    SQLFiles[Sample SQL files]
    Mapper[ChatOllama lineage extraction]
    JSON[graph_data.json fixture]
    Builder[NetworkX DiGraph]
    Upstream[get_upstream_tables]
    Downstream[get_downstream_tables]
    Agent[ChatOllama ReAct loop]
    Answer[Text answer]
    HTML[Optional PyVis HTML output]

    SQLFiles --> Mapper
    Mapper --> JSON
    JSON --> Builder
    Builder --> Upstream
    Builder --> Downstream
    Query[Lineage question] --> Agent
    Agent --> Upstream
    Agent --> Downstream
    Upstream --> Agent
    Downstream --> Agent
    Agent --> Answer
    Builder --> HTML

    note1[Lineage accuracy depends on LLM extraction; graph traversal is in memory]
    note1 -.-> Mapper
